  "definition": "Required Standard Permit and Transfer Facility Permit Application Information",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-08-14",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Hw 300) #9362, eff 1-28-09; amd by #10205, eff 10-19-12; ss by #12345, eff 8-14-17",
